    "kind": "image",
    "pages": [
      {
        "number": 1,
        "text": "Dr daffys Elixar from his owne hand\n\nTake 3 pints of aqua-vita, of Rhubarb and Sena each half an ounce. Coriander & aniseed half an ounce, one quarter of a drachm of Saffron, 3 pennyworth of Cochineal, one ounce of Liquorish, 1 pound of Raisins of the sun stoned. let the Rhubarb and Liquoris be sliced, the seeds and Saffron rubbed in a mortar, then put all the ingredients into the aqua-vita and let it stand a weeke\n\nThen strain it but dont squeeze the Cloth. to the same ingredients you may put a pint of aqua-vita more, let it stand a week & it will be as good as the other.\ntake 1-2 or 3 spoonfuls at night going to bed and in the morning as you find occasion it purges gently. you need not keep the House, you may make it with Brandy insted of aqua-vita but aqua-vita is best",
        "method": "vision",
        "decoration_text": [
          "13"
        ],
